        1287,
        1427,
        1398
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Local Law No. 178 of 2017 created the Office of Nightlife to be located\nwithin the office of the Mayor or within any agency that does not conduct enforcement against\nnightlife establishments;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
